WEBVTT

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:19.560
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.700
Episode 1
The Final Decision

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.510
<i>My name is You Keika.</i>

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:52.920
<i>My home life fell into ruin when 
my parents died when I was little.</i>

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:57.010
<i>I just barely managed to eke out a 
living by undertaking computer repairs.</i>

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.890
Computer King! Computer King!

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>My neighbors even gave me the 
nickname of "Computer King."</i>

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.890
Computer King

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.060
<i>I'm sure God took pity on me living like that</i>

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:07.850
<i>and I was given a new role 
after being hit by a truck.</i>

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.300
<i>This country lost one of 
its future business moguls.</i>

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.530
You Keika, did you go hungry 
while you were alive?

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:23.380
I hadn't eaten anything for three days 
before I died, so of course I'm hungry!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.240
So disgusting. Mind your manners.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.170
<i>That's Tanmoku Ki.</i>

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:29.980
<i>He is a Youmeishi who maintains the 
balance between light and darkness,</i>

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:31.500
<i>and I am his spirit shadow.</i>

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.620
<i>I'm basically his follower.</i>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:40.910
Mind my manners? If I dine in silence, then 
it's the same as eating alone with a log!

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:43.700
At least I don't fart or burp!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.710
I'll have my family join us next time.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:52.440
Well, Keika, are you getting along with Ki?

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.480
Have you gotten used to sleeping together?

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.540
He doesn't kick off the covers, does he?

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.220
I'll have more blankets brought 
up just in case you get cold.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.650
Please spare me...

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:08.420
<i>Tanmoku Ki is a pretty stuffy guy, 
but there isn't anything he can't do.</i>

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:12.500
<i>He's smart, good at household chores, 
and he can exterminate youkai as well.</i>

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.270
<i>It's like he's the hero from a game.</i>

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.230
<b>Kings of Glory - Champion Luban</b>

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.570
<i>He's so perfect, it makes me jealous.</i>

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:21.830
I've been your spirit shadow for a 
while, but I haven't learned a thing.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.300
Shouldn't we be like training or something?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.060
I absorb things quickly,
so I'm not good at teaching.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.520
What a disagreeable guy.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.520
Anyway, I want to get stronger!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.520
You won against my master, 
didn't you? That's enough.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:40.030
It's not! I at least want 
to beat that redhead.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.490
Oh? In Tetsu?

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.490
I get it now.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:50.140
Starting today, you will 
be In Tetsu's apprentice.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.450
Excuse me?!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.450
Excuse me?!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.010
Hey, what kind of joke is this?

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.570
<i>This is In Tetsu. He's a fox spirit.</i>

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.880
<i>He's the master of the Tanmoku family's 
Mount Ura. While he's strong,</i>

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.510
<i>he's also pretty standoffish.</i>

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.510
Hey, Tanmoku Ki, are you being serious?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:10.920
In Tetsu was once a spirit shadow and 
you do want to beat him, don't you?

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:13.020
Then he's the right person.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.480
And what if I refuse?

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:20.780
You lost to me. You have no right to refuse.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.870
I'm going back to the house.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.410
You two get along.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.080
T-Tanmoku Ki...

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.870
I don't want to learn from this guy!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.870
I don't want to teach this guy!

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.010
Are you really going to 
leave him behind, Ki-chan?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:46.010
Other youkai will attack him, 
even if In Tetsu-sama won't.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.010
Why won't you teach him yourself?

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:52.020
You have both the knowledge and ability, 
so you're the prime person for the job.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.390
I don't have time.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:59.970
You don't have... time?

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.190
That red-headed bastard...
 How is this basic training?!

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.750
Making me do this crap.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.790
Spirits don't need muscle training!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.830
This is definitely harassment!

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:21.680
Stop!

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.630
Wait!

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.190
You can't get away now.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:37.850
Stop it!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.860
This is my turf! Don't go 
doing whatever you want!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.460
You again?

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:48.200
That's a youkai! Don't stick your 
nose in our youkai business!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.790
Don't bully a girl!

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.450
How does that look like a girl?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:04.840
U-Um, anyway! I make the rules around here!

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:10.030
If the Youmeishi and In Tetsu-sama 
weren't around, we'd kick your butt.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:10.680
Let's go.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.290
Yeah.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:15.090
Yes, yes, come back anytime. 
Be careful on your way home.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:19.020
You're not a youkai from 
around here, are you?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.020
These are the Youmeishi's lands. 
You should go home.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:25.060
Thank you for saving me. You're...

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:29.780
I'll tell you. I'm the 
Youmeishi's spirit shadow.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.490
Wow, I heard that the current 
Youmeishi is the strongest ever.

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.420
Are you really the Youmeishi's 
spirit shadow?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.910
Hey, are you making fun of me?!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.750
Stay there and watch closely.
I'll show you my power.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.930
<i>That was definitely cool.</i>

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.970
Wow, you're amazing!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:16.620
I'll be your follower, starting today.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.450
I'll listen to anything you say.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.800
You understand my greatness?

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.160
Yes, you're incredible!

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:28.170
Oh yeah, if you're close to the Youmeishi, 
will you let me meet him?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.420
Meet Tanmoku Ki?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.930
I have a favor to ask him.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.460
I dunno...

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.270
It's okay if I can't.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.480
The Youmeishi is probably a scary person.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:46.480
It's fine. He's a friendly 
enough person. Leave it to me.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:51.500
I'm glad! I knew I could count on you!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:53.910
No.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.280
What?! Why not?

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.780
Forbidden Spells   Spirit Bondage

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.190
You're a reasonable man, right?

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.790
That's the first I'm hearing of it.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.190
You're so mean, Ki-shama.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:07.160
This is a good opportunity to prove 
you're actually really friendly.

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.500
Friendly?

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:13.760
There is no way I can be 
friendly with a youkai.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:19.270
Tanmoku Ki, I gave that kid hope.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:23.100
All you have to do is just go 
meet with him for a bit, please.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.570
<i>Tanmoku Ki is always like this.</i>

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.740
<i>He won't listen to anyone.</i>

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>I always thought he was easy to 
talk to, but maybe it's just me?</i>

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:39.030
Mr. Spirit Shadow, will I be 
able to meet the Youmeishi?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:43.790
W-Well... the weather is so nice today.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.300
It feels so great.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.590
Let's go on a walk.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.840
Come with me.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.890
Look, this is my protection charm.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.840
Will you give this to the Youmeishi?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.050
Oh, that's really pretty.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.110
This is your true form, right?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.060
So it would be like sending 
a part of yourself.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.680
You're right.

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.690
When will I be able to meet him then?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.820
Honestly, he's been pretty busy lately.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.910
I'm not going to get to meet him, am I?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.400
That's not true; you will.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.500
He's just been really busy.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.800
Why do you want to meet him?

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.190
My hometown was attacked.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:46.980
I escaped with the elders, but I was 
the only one who made it this far.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.110
The Youmeishi will listen 
to a spirit's wish, won't he?

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.050
That's why I want him to help me.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:56.030
You've really had it rough for a kid.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.910
Apparently this mountain 
environment doesn't suit me.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.830
At this rate, I'll probably die too.

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:08.770
It'll be okay. I'll convince him and 
definitely make him meet with you.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.540
Thank you, Mr. Spirit Shadow!

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:14.250
Just hang in there for a few more 
days and don't cause any trouble.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:15.790
Okay!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.100
Tanmoku Ki, meet with that boy!

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:21.260
Shut up. I'm busy.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.680
Is a talisman more important than a spirit?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:28.560
His hometown was attacked 
and he needs your help.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.110
You're not friends with this boy, are you?

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.730
Keika, don't trust a youkai.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:37.820
They will deceive you.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.990
Ki-sama, Rin-sama is waiting 
for you in the garden.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.510
Right.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:48.500
Tanmoku Ki, I'll ask you one more 
time: will you or will you not go?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:53.110
That boy is a youkai. Don't 
keep making me repeat myself.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.030
Master.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.470
Ah, Ki, please sit.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:08.480
Do you know where this is from?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.980
It's the legendary Underworld Soul 
Binding spell used for binding spirits.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.940
I need it for something.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:20.530
Ki, you know this is a 
forbidden spell, don't you?

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:24.490
Yes, but it is very important.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:27.490
It has to do with his existence.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.750
What was that crap about listening 
to wishes? What a hypocrite.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:38.370
La, lala, lala, Youmeishi! 
La, lala, lala!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:43.200
Hey there, kid. So you're 
still hanging around?

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.680
You should've gone home quietly.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.020
Do you want to get hurt?

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.660
Let's take him to In Tetsu-sama.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:49.380
Okay.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:55.440
<i>Huh? Where's the stone boy?</i>

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:59.090
Hey, stone boy! Stone boy?

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.990
That's weird. Where did he go?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:05.370
Do you not understand what I'm saying?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.630
Leave the mountain and stay 
away from the Youmeishi.

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:12.000
If you take one more step into 
the mountain, I will kill you.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:15.420
I'm definitely going to meet the Youmeishi.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.420
Everyone is counting on me.

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:23.300
In Tetsu-sama! The spirit 
shadow is back again!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.220
Stop it.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.970
That kid is a friend of mine.

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:31.690
Well, if it isn't my apprentice.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:35.430
So you're hanging out with your 
friend instead of training?

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.360
Are you trying to defy your master?

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.070
Mr. Spirit Shadow...

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.530
If you hurt that boy, I'll—

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.490
You'll what?

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.910
Don't try to be so brave.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:50.770
I'll clear your mind of idle thoughts
 since your master isn't here.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.760
You should be grateful to me.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.290
Let him go.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:59.160
Fine then, since it's a request 
from my adorable apprentice,

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.460
I will grant you your wish.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:06.930
What are you going to do?

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:08.890
I'm going to let him go.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.720
Hey, stop it!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.980
Stone boy!

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.110
Damn you!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.010
Satisfied now?

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.300
Red-headed bastard, don't screw with me!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.940
Are you going to kill your master for him?

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:41.130
Perfect.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.510
I'll punish you!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.090
In Tetsu-sama and the spirit 
shadow are fighting! Run away!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.420
You reap what you sow!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.960
I thought I'd gotten stronger,

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.000
but there's still such a 
massive difference between us.

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:23.250
There's no way an apprentice 
could win against their master.

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.090
Damn it.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.820
How dare you lay a hand on my spirit shadow?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.780
Tanmoku Ki, what are you doing?

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:52.660
I told you: don't hurt my spirit shadow.

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.510
I've heard that line more 
times than I can count.

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.890
Obstinate bastard.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:57.910
While we're at it,

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.570
why don't you show me 
your superior spiritual power?

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:04.050
Tanmoku Ki is amazing.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:07.010
They're fighting equally unarmed.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.340
That's right, stone boy!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.500
Hang in there, stone boy!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.680
Mr. Spirit Shadow?

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:19.290
Stone boy...

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:24.500
Thank you for saving me.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.780
I'll take you to Tanmoku immediately.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:37.450
That light is the Youmeishi, right?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:41.050
Yes, he came to see you. 
You'll be able to meet him soon.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:46.050
He is a kind person after all.

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.290
He'll save you.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.780
I'm going to die soon.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:59.640
Youkai born from stone will die 
if they leave their hometown.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:04.640
We can gain human form with 
the Youmeishi's powers.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:11.310
Every year during the ritual, the light the 
priest emits rains down from a distance.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:14.850
We bask in that light and are baptized.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:21.890
My hometown is already gone and 
all my friends are probably dead,

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:27.130
but I made up my mind to come 
here before I leave this world,

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:31.820
because I wanted to say 
"thank you," to the priest.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:38.710
My hometown was destroyed by humans, 
but the priest is also human.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:46.900
I can die in peace knowing that there are 
people like the priest in this world,

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.580
but I'm sad I'll never get to meet him.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:51.150
You will.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.220
He's right there. You'll meet him soon.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:06.590
Tanmoku Ki.

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.000
You're finally able to meet him.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.810
Stone boy?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.690
Stone boy...

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.190
Was that your friend?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:38.030
He came from so far away just to say 
thank you for the power you gave him,

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.820
so why couldn't you have met with him?!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:41.580
Keika.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.870
I don't want to talk to you!

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.010
Tanmoku Ki.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.390
This is what happens when you protect him.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.950
That's none of your concern.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.580
I will destroy this mountain.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:13.400
In Tetsu-sama, why do you argue with 
Ki-chan? You're not even rivals.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.090
I'm just killing time a bit.

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:23.070
<i>That's your son for you, Gin.</i>

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.780
I miss Gin-sama too.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:36.840
Keika.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:41.550
This is...

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.160
It was that boy's.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:50.900
He might one day regain a 
human form, if you wear this.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.060
Really?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:58.230
I didn't meet with him because
I did not know he was innocent.

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:02.340
I've had so many bad experiences.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:09.180
When I saw that stone boy, 
he reminded me of another child.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.870
There was construction on the 
road to school at the time,

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:16.050
and there was always a boy playing 
in the sand by himself.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.860
You're weird.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:20.050
His home is messed up, too.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.550
Stop it. Don't bully him!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.510
I'll protect this kid!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:32.450
But before we could learn each 
other's names, we were separated.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:38.270
That's why I wanted to help the stone boy, 
even just a little bit.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.170
When was that?

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:46.490
It was when I was in elementary 
school, so over ten years ago?

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.500
Mom, I made a friend!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.370
Really? That's wonderful.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:55.690
Yeah. He could also see spirits.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.310
What's the matter?

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:00.970
Nothing.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.640
Do you know what a pact connection is?

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:08.220
P-P-Pact connection?

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:12.810
It's when a Youmeishi and spirit 
shadow share their soul and power.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.060
Tanmoku Ki...

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:19.370
Hey, are you going to kiss me again?

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:23.780
Find some other way to make this 
p-pact thingy or whatever it is.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:28.180
Yes, but sharing the soul isn't easy.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:29.660
Don't be shocked.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.850
Where am I?

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.090
My...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.220
ocean of the soul.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.680
T-Tanmoku Ki...

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:54.810
<i>A human spirit appears in the form that 
was the most shining from its life.</i>

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.320
<i>A Tanmoku Ki that I don't know.</i>

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:01.570
What's down there?

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:04.140
Don't look.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.330
You don't need to see it.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.780
Make a vow with me, Keika.

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:18.540
<i>There were so many things that I wanted 
to ask him, but I couldn't form the words.</i>

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:24.970
<i>I felt like our relationship would 
change if I learned too much.</i>

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:29.350
Security is tight and there 
are fox spirits on Mount Ura.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:30.750
How should we break in?

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.770
Let's use the new spirit shadow; he's weak.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.040
Don't be stupid.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.900
He'll come and no one will 
be able to interfere.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:44.490
So we should start working on 
the head of the family directly.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.780
But how do we separate them?

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:52.160
If you separate him from his spirit shadow, 
then there are many ways to destroy him.

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:55.300
We're going to use that.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:39.930
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.590
He might one day regain a 
human form, if you wear this.

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.720
When can I see you again?

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:33.250
Today is the first and last time.

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:35.850
Even if you recover quickly, 
don't just throw your life away!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Seeing is Believing</b>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.930
Go hide somewhere. This is 
all just your imagination.
